{"1308750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In Our Nature", "steam_appid": 1308750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, interactive story about ambition, loss, love and the natural world around us. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.poster.avif?t=1773500898\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.webm?t=1773500898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.mp4?t=1773500898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruth spends her entire day sorting and stamping papers when her boss finally offers her the chance to unleash her talent and save the company from financial ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover the beauty of the Canadian wilderness with Ruth in a wonderful, low-poly adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analog photography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60s Nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Voiced </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly aesthetic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of Story-driven Gameplay  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, interactive story about ambition, loss, love and the natural world around us. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.poster.avif?t=1773500898\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.webm?t=1773500898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308750/extras/1434ec0b1fd38ecf9f14227560476b8a.mp4?t=1773500898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruth spends her entire day sorting and stamping papers when her boss finally offers her the chance to unleash her talent and save the company from financial ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover the beauty of the Canadian wilderness with Ruth in a wonderful, low-poly adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analog photography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60s Nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Voiced </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly aesthetic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of Story-driven Gameplay  </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Embark on a journey with Ruth, an adventurous hobbyist photographer, as she escapes her boring office job to chase down the rare Kirtland's Warbler.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header